1
00:00:00,000 --> 00:00:03,000
One sky. At the Lantern Festival —
people honour the Heaven Official.

2
00:00:03,000 --> 00:00:08,000
It is also the Upper Yuan: the Heaven
Official’s birthday.

3
00:00:12,000 --> 00:00:19,000
Another name: Ziwei Dadi. The same name
as the northern sky’s centre: the Ziwei
Enclosure.

4
00:00:23,000 --> 00:00:30,000
One is a god. One is a star region: the
Sky Emperor’s palace, the sky’s turning
hub.

5
00:00:30,000 --> 00:00:37,000
Just outside its walls: the Big Dipper.
Sima Qian called it the Sky Emperor’s
chariot.

6
00:00:37,000 --> 00:00:44,000
Tonight, after dark, look east: a nearly
full Moon with Jupiter and Mars close
by.

7
00:00:44,000 --> 00:00:48,000
Belarus: a farmer’s sky and Elijah’s
chariot.

8
00:00:48,000 --> 00:00:51,000
Follow for a new sky every week.

